         they ARE 1.12 globals an addon's XML may inherit; the state textures below also carry the
         resolved art inline, for the reason in the header. -->
    <Texture name="UIPanelButtonUpTexture" file="Interface\Buttons\UI-Panel-Button-Up" virtual="true">
        <TexCoords left="0" right="0.625" top="0" bottom="0.6875"/>
